<h5 id=3D"the-outcome-of-the-sft-stage">The outcome of the SFT stage</h5>
<p>The outcome of this stage is the SFT model, a finetuned version of the b=
ase model. Instead of merely continuing the text prompt, the SFT model gene=
rates detailed and helpful responses because it has been trained on demonst=
ration data in a (prompt, response) format.</p>
