<p>To summarize the training section, we employ a three-stage training stra=
tegy, including pretraining, SFT, and RLHF. Pretraining involves training a=
 model on a large corpus of text to gain a broad language understanding. SF=
T finetunes the model to adapt its output to a (prompt, response) format. R=
LHF further refines the model's responses to be helpful, safe, and aligned =
with human preferences.</p>
