<h4 id=3D"deterministic-methods">Deterministic methods</h4>
<p>Deterministic methods such as beam search work well for tasks with short=
, predictable text lengths. However, they are less effective for open-ended=
 generation, such as dialogue, where output length varies. Let's examine th=
e common issues that arise when using deterministic methods like greedy sea=
rch or beam search to generate text from LLMs.</p>
<h5 id=3D"greedy-search">Greedy search</h5>
<p>Greedy search selects the token with the highest probability at each ste=
p of the generation process.</p>
<figure class=3D"py-1"><div style=3D"display: flex; justify-content: center=
;"><img alt=3D"Image represents a directed graph illustrating word probabil=
ities in a sentence.  A thick, solid horizontal line labeled 'How' connects=
