?' acts as an input prompt to the LLM.  An upward-pointing arrow connects t=
his prompt to the LLM, indicating the flow of information into the model.  =
Above the rectangle, the text 'The weather today is sunny. The weathe...' r=
epresents the output generated by the LLM in response to the input prompt. =
An upward-pointing arrow connects the LLM to this output, showing the infor=
mation flow from the model. The overall diagram depicts a basic question-an=
swering process where a user's query ('How is the weather?') is processed b=
y the LLM, resulting in a textual response ('The weather today is sunny...'=
)." loading=3D"lazy" width=3D"360" height=3D"216" decoding=3D"async" data-n=
img=3D"1" src=3D"https://bytebytego.com/images/courses/genai-system-design-=
