t: center;"><figcaption class=3D"py-1">Figure 22: Repetitive output</figcap=
tion></div></figure>
<p><strong>Suboptimal generation:</strong> Greedy search ignores alternativ=
e paths during the text generation. It might miss a high-probability sequen=
ce of tokens hidden behind a low-probability token.</p>
<h5 id=3D"beam-search">Beam search</h5>
<p>Beam search improves upon greedy search by considering multiple sequence=
s simultaneously. At each step, it keeps track of the top k sequences, wher=
e k is configurable.</p>
<figure class=3D"py-1"><div style=3D"display: flex; justify-content: center=
;"><img alt=3D"Image represents a probabilistic context-free grammar (PCFG)=
