=3D"color: transparent;"></div><div style=3D"display: flex; justify-content=
: center;"><figcaption class=3D"py-1">Figure 24: Multinomial sampling</figc=
aption></div></figure>
<p>This approach ensures a wide variety of possible outputs. However, it in=
troduces a significant amount of randomness, especially when the probabilit=
y distribution is flat. This randomness often results in generations that a=
re not coherent. For example, the generated text shown in Figure 25 is the =
output of the GPT-2 model using multinomial sampling.</p>
