<p>Due to coherence issues, multinomial sampling is rarely used in LLMs for=
 text generation.</p>
<h5 id=3D"top-k-sampling">Top-k sampling</h5>
<p>Top-k sampling [30] is a more advanced method that selects from the <em>=
k</em> most likely tokens rather than sampling from the entire distribution=
.</p>
<figure class=3D"py-1"><div style=3D"display: flex; justify-content: center=
