<p>The top-p sampling is widely used in advanced LLMs to generate human-lik=
e text. This method ensures the text is coherent and contextually relevant =
by focusing on the most probable tokens while allowing some randomness.</p>
<p>While we covered the key aspects of different sampling methods, there ar=
e more details to each method. Two popular techniques often used in advance=
d sampling methods are:</p>
<ul>
<li>Temperature</li>
<li>Repetition penalty</li>
</ul>
