<p>In modern LLMs, the temperature parameter typically ranges from 0.1 to 1=
.5. When set beyond 1.5, outputs can become increasingly erratic and less c=
oherent, which is undesirable. The optimal value depends on the desired beh=
avior and is often determined empirically. The following table, created by =
